        {
          "text": "Lino Boazi wakamuvwiila kuti, Ncobeni ndakalwiidwa makani oonse ngowakacitila banyokozyala kuzwa kuciindi calufu lwamulumaako. Ndamvwa mbowakasia uso abanyoko anyika yakuzyalwa kwako, ambowakeza okuno kumusyobo ngowatakezi. ",
          "type": "text",
