        {
          "text": "Jehova akupe coolwe nkaambo kamilimo yako, ukatambule bulumbu buzulide kuzwa kumaanza aa-Jehova Leza wa-Israyeli, ngonguwe ngowajana mayubilo kunsi amababa aakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
