          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo wakacibweza, wainka aco kumunzi, watondezya banyinazyala ncaakavulwide. Azyalo zilyo nzyaakasiide naakamana kukuta, wakazileta, wabapa nzizyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino banyinazyala bakamubuzya kuti, Wali kuyoovulula kuli sunu? Wali kubeleka kuli? Alumbwe muntu oyo iwakakugwasya. Mpawo wakalwiida banyinazyala nkwaakali kubeleka. Wakati, Muntu nkundali kubeleka kulinguwe sunu, izina lyakwe ngu-Boazi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
