            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Naomi wakaambila mukamwana wakwe kuti, Jehova amupe coolwe, oyo uutaleki luzyalo lwakwe nekuba kubaumi nekuba kubafu. Alimwi Naomi wakamwaambila kuti, Oyo muntu ngumukwesu, ngusiluzuboma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Rute mu-Moabu wakati, Alimwi wakandaambila kuti, Uleelede kukakatila kubalanda bangu, mane lumwi bakamanisye kutebula kwangu koonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Naomi wakaambila Rute mukamwana wakwe kuti, Ee, mwanaangu, ncobeni ncibotu kuti koinka abana basimbi bakwe, nkaambo mumuunda umbi ambweni uyoopenzegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aboobo wakakakatila kubasimbi baBoazi, akuya buvulula mane kusikila kumamanino aakutebula kwabbaale akutebula kwabulotwe. Nkabela wakali kukala abanyinazyala.",
          "type": "text",
